 planner is understanding a client&#8217;s style. This is because a client&#8217;s wedding should reflect their style and personality and not mine. Ceri &amp; Bart asked me to come up with a design that was personal to them, a bit fun but not tacky. We incorporated the design across all their wedding stationary and I wonder if you can spot what it is. Love, love, love working with these two:-)<\/p>\n<p>Grab a cuppa and enjoy the details of their day.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-39 fusion-gallery-layout-grid fusion-gallery-1\"><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall.jpg\" width=\"3600\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"\" title=\"craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall\" aria-label=\"craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-851\" srcset=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall-200x133.jpg 200w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall-400x267.jpg 400w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographypendrellhall-800x533.jpg 800w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/craiggeorgeweddingphotographyp